      "fontSize": 18,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "text": "Small diamonds = possible finite deposits.\nAn extractor would be built on a deposit,\nwith income paid to its builder. More than\none can fit in a resource region.\n\nMarker count and resource types are NOT\nfinal. No workers are shown.",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "baseline": 16,
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Small diamonds = possible finite deposits.\nAn extractor would be built on a deposit,\nwith income paid to its builder. More than\none can fit in a resource region.\n\nMarker count and resource types are NOT\nfinal. No workers are shown.",
